<div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9 col-md-11">
            <div class="privacy-card">

                <h1 class="policy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="text-center text-muted mb-4">Effective Date: February , 2026</p>

                <p>Welcome to <strong>LocalTravelStay</strong>. We value your privacy and are committed to
                    protecting your personal data. This policy explains how we handle your information.</p>

                <hr>

                <div class="section-heading">1. Information We Collect</div>
                <p>We keep it simple. We only collect:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Mobile Number:</strong> Necessary for creating your account.</li>
                    <li><strong>OTP (One-Time Password):</strong> Used only for secure login verification to prevent
                        unauthorized access.</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="section-heading">2. How We Use Your Data</div>
                <p>Your mobile number is used strictly for identity verification. <strong>Important:</strong> We do
                    not share your mobile number with any vendors. While you can see the vendor’s contact info, your
                    number remains hidden unless you choose to contact them yourself.</p>

                <div class="section-heading">3. Data Security</div>
                <div class="data-box">
                    <strong>Zero Spam Policy:</strong> We never sell, rent, or trade your mobile number to
                    third-party marketing companies. Your data is stored in our encrypted database.
                </div>

                <div class="section-heading">4. Third-Party Interaction</div>
                <p>When you click to call a vendor, you are interacting with them directly. Their own privacy
                    practices apply at that point. We recommend being cautious when sharing personal documents like
                    Aadhar or PAN cards over direct calls.</p>

                <div class="section-heading">5. Legal Disclosure</div>
                <p>In accordance with Indian Law, we may share data logs only if formally requested by Law
                    Enforcement agencies (Police) under a valid legal warrant or investigation notice.</p>

                <div class="section-heading">6. Updates</div>
                <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Your continued use of the platform after updates
                    means you accept the revised policy.</p>

                <div class="footer-text">
                    <p>&copy; 2026 LocalTravelStay. All rights reserved.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
